    "tagline": "Want to improve your logistic processes? We are building the future of logistics. Contact us 👇",
    "description": "The logistic industry is affected by intransparencies and inconsistencies along the entire supply chain. Nearly half of all trucks wait on average more than one hour for a usually scheduled offloading at a warehouse due to poor alignment of involved partners. Up to 30% of all trucks in transit run empty due to market intransparencies. We at TradeLink made it our mission to solve intransparencies. Our platform enables frictionless supply chain collaboration within all involved parties. We offer you the solution of nearly all your logistics pain points: no more surprises at the ramp, no more downtime on the yard, no costly and faulty paper processes, no more countless mailings and calls, no more stressed employees. \nIf you are ready to transform your business now, contact us and shape the future of logistics with TradeLink!  \n\nReach out to us 📥 hello@tradelink.co",
